All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.4.1] - 2026-09-05

### Changed
- **Documentation:**
  - fixed typo in the README file

## [0.4.0] - 2026-09-05

### Changed
- **Repository Structure:**
  - updated dev script to rely on active venv
- **Backend Setup:**
  - updated pip requirements
  - updated backend settings to read secrets from env file
- **Frontend Setup:**
  - changed title
  - changed favicon
- **Documentation:**
  - updated the README file

### Removed
- **Backend Setup:**
  - sqlite3 file
- **Frontend Setup:**
  - api calls form the app file

### Added
- **Backend Setup:**
  - Secret keys
  - env file

## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-04

### Removed
- **3D Geospatial Visualization:**
  - Removed Cesium's proprietary ION assets
  - Removed currently unnecessary viewer options

### Added
- **3D Geospatial Visualization:**
  - Configured OpenStreetMap as the default imagery provider

---

## [0.2.0] - 2026-09-04

### Added
- **3D Geospatial Visualization:**
  - Integrated CesiumJS and Resium into the React frontend.
  - Configured `vite-plugin-cesium` in `vite.config.js` to manage static Cesium assets.
  - Added initial 3D interactive `Globe` component rendered inside `App.jsx`.
- **Documentation:** Initial `CHANGELOG.md`.

---

## [0.1.0] - Initial Setup

### Added
- **Repository Structure:** Monorepo architecture split into `backend/` and `frontend/`.
- **Backend Setup:**
  - Configured Django project (`core`) and app routes (`api`).
  - Integrated `djangorestframework` and `django-cors-headers`.
  - Added initial endpoint (`/api/hello/`).
- **Frontend Setup:**
  - Initialized React application with Vite.
  - Connected API fetching layer to the Django backend.
- **Documentation:** Initial `README.md` and `.gitignore`.